一下都觉得累。\n我好像就是这样，烂泥扶不上墙。每天都在自我拉扯，一边愧疚自己的摆烂，一边又控制不住地沉沦。不想社交，不想说话，甚至不想呼吸，觉得自己就是个多余的人，一事无成，浑浑噩噩。\n身边的人都在往前走，只有我，停在原地，甚至在往后退。我抓不住任何东西，也留不住任何温暖，就这样吧，就这样烂下去也挺好，反正，我也没什么值得被期待的，日复一日，耗光所有力气。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "role_bank", "links": [46], "label": "role_bank", "type": "QWEN3_ROLE_BANK", "localized_name": "role_bank"}], "size": [270, 366], "pos": [2770.961181640625, 310.2362976074219], "widgets_values": ["兔妈妈", "小兔子", "大灰狼", "Role4", "Role5", "Role6", "Role7", "Role8"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_1", "link": 43, "label": "prompt_1", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_2", "link": 44, "label": "prompt_2", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_3", "link": 45, "label": "prompt_3", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_4", "label": "prompt_4", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_5", "label": "prompt_5", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_6", "label": "prompt_6", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_7", "label": "prompt_7", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_8", "label": "prompt_8", "type": "VOICE_CLONE_PROMPT", "localized_name": "prompt_8"}, {"widget": {"name": "role_name_1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "role_name_1", "label": "role_name_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role_name_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "role_name_2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "role_name_2", "label": "role_name_2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "ro